"╭ Lists ───────────────────────────╮╭ Tasks ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮"
"│ No lists yet. Press o to create  ││ Select a list and press enter                                                    │"
"│ one.                             ││                                                                                  │"
"│     ╭ Help ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮     │"
"│     │  zR                      unfold everything                                                               │     │"
"│     │  dd                      delete the selected list, folder or task                                        │     │"
"│     │Lists pane                                                                                                │     │"
"│     │  enter                   open the selected list, or fold or unfold a folder                              │     │"
"│     │  o                       create a list next to the selection or inside the folder                        │     │"
"│     │  O                       create a folder                                                                 │     │"
"│     │  r                       rename the selected list or folder                                              │     │"
"│     │  m                       move the list, folder or selection into a folder                                │     │"
"│     │  H                       show or hide hidden folders and lists                                           │     │"
"│     │Tasks pane                                                                                                │     │"
"│     │  o                       add a task below the selected one                                               │     │"
"│     │  O                       add a task above the selected one                                               │     │"
"│     │  a                       add a subtask to the selected task                                              │     │"
"│     │  i, enter                edit the task text                                                              █     │"
"│     │  x, space                mark as done or open again                                                      █     │"
"│     │  yy                      copy the task and its subtasks                                                  █     │"
"│     │  p                       paste below the selected task                                                   █     │"
"│     │  P                       paste above the selected task                                                   █     │"
"│     │  J                       swap with the next sibling                                                      █     │"
"│     │  K                       swap with the previous sibling                                                  █     │"
"│     │  >                       make it a subtask of the task above                                             █     │"
"│     │  <                       move it one level up                                                            █     │"
"│     │  +                       raise the priority                                                              █     │"
"│     │  -                       lower the priority                                                              █     │"
"│     │  D                       set or clear the due date                                                       █     │"
"│     │  r                       set or clear the recurrence                                                     █     │"
"│     │  H                       show or hide completed tasks                                                    █     │"
"│     │Sorting (lists pane and tasks pane)                                                                       █     │"
"│     │  sp                      sort by priority, highest first                                                 █     │"
"│     │  sd                      sort by due date, earliest first, without one last                              █     │"
"│     │  sa                      sort by text or name                                                            █     │"
"│     │  ss                      sort tasks: open tasks first                                                    █     │"
"│     │  so                      sort lists: most open tasks first                                               █     │"
"│     │  st                      sort lists: most tasks first                                                    █     │"
"│     │Visual mode (lists pane, tasks pane and bin)                                                              █     │"
"│     │  v                       select several rows from here on, or stop selecting                             █     │"
"│     │  d                       delete the selected tasks, lists or folders                                     █     │"
"│     │  y                       copy the selected tasks and their subtasks                                      █     │"
"│     │Bin (lists pane)                                                                                          █     │"
"│     │  R                       move the entry or the selection back to where it came from                      █     │"
"│     │  E                       delete everything in the bin permanently (asks first)                           │     │"
"│     │  h, left, esc            return to the lists                                                             │     │"
"│     │Help screen, dialogs and text input                                                                       │     │"
"│     │  ?, q, esc               close the help screen                                                           │     │"
"│     │  y, enter                confirm                                                                         │     │"
"│     │  n, esc                  cancel                                                                          │     │"
"│     │  enter                   accept the text                                                                 │     │"
"│     │  shift-enter, alt-enter  accept the text and add another task below it                                   │     │"
"│     │  esc, ctrl-c             discard the text, or end the selection                                          │     │"
"│     │Picker (go to anything and folders)                                                                       │     │"
"│     │  ctrl-j, down, ctrl-n    select the next match                                                           │     │"
"│     │  ctrl-k, up, ctrl-p      select the previous match                                                       │     │"
"│     ╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── 26-77/100 ╯     │"
"│                                  ││                                                                                  │"
"╰──────────────────────────────────╯╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯"
" / search                                                                                                       ? close "
